g) A recreational non-motorised water sports concession area;

h) A sewage treatment plant; and

i) Six (6) basic accommodation huts, known as Barra Huts, currently under construction.

The six (6) Barra Huts will provide basic accommodation only and will not include bathroom or kitchen facilities. Each hut is intended to be furnished with a bed frame, mattress, bar fridge, air conditioning, fan, and a table and chair on the veranda. Guests will be responsible for providing their own linen. Floor plans and final specifications are not currently available, as the huts remain in the construction and fit-out process.

